    Profile_set_spirit_text(p, "Your nature is overwhelming love disguised as ordinariness. You appeared to do nothing — sitting under a blanket, eating fruit, telling jokes — and yet people left your presence transformed in ways they could never quite explain. Your miracles were the least interesting thing about you; your love was everything.");
