    Profile_set_spirit_text(p, "Your nature is playful liberation. Where Laozi wrote concise verses, you wrote wild stories — of giant fish becoming giant birds, of useless trees that outlive the useful, of Cook Ding's knife that never dulls because it finds the spaces between joints. Your humor is the solvent that dissolves the prison of fixed views.");
